## English Terms

### 1. Definitions

1.1 **"Software"** means all source code, documentation, model files and derivative
works in this repository, including but not limited to every module under `kaederonm_kg/`.

1.2 **"Commercial Use"** means any use aimed at obtaining, directly or indirectly,
economic benefit, including but not limited to:

  (a) integrating the Software, in whole or in part, into any product or service
      that is sold, leased, or offered on a paid subscription basis;
  (b) using the Software to provide paid security scanning, sample analysis,
      or threat assessment services to customers;
  (c) using the Software in production within a for-profit organization, including
      internal business systems and externally facing services;
  (d) offering hosted services (SaaS), API services, or cloud scanning services
      built on the Software;
  (e) distributing the Software as a product, or as a primary selling point of one.

1.3 **"Non-Commercial Use"** means use not aimed at economic benefit, including
personal study, academic research, teaching, charitable use by non-profit
organizations, and testing conducted to evaluate whether to purchase a commercial
license.

1.4 **"Licensor"** means KaeDeRonm (凯德荣), the copyright holder of the Software.

### 2. Grant for Non-Commercial Use

Subject to full compliance with this License, the Licensor grants you a free,
non-exclusive, non-transferable license to:

  (a) use, copy and modify the Software for Non-Commercial Use;
  (b) distribute the Software and your modifications for Non-Commercial Use,
      **provided that** you:
      (i) retain this License in full together with all copyright notices;
      (ii) clearly indicate any modifications you made;
      (iii) license your modified version under this same License.

### 3. Commercial Use Requires a License

3.1 **Any Commercial Use requires the prior written permission of the Licensor.**

3.2 Commercial licenses are negotiated separately and may involve fees, scope
limitations, and support terms. Requests should be made via the contact details
at the end of this file.

3.3 **If you engage in Commercial Use without a written license**, the Licensor may
require you to cease use immediately and delete all copies, and reserves the right
to pursue legal remedies.

3.4 The Licensor is under **no obligation** to grant any commercial license.

### 4. Restrictions

Without the Licensor's prior written consent, you **may not**:

  (a) use the Software or any derivative work for Commercial Use in any form;
  (b) remove or alter any copyright, license, or attribution notice in the Software;
  (c) sublicense the Software to third parties, or distribute it under any other license;
  (d) claim endorsement or certification by the Licensor on behalf of the Software.

### 5. Disclaimer of Warranty

**THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND**, express or
implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability, fitness for
a particular purpose, and noninfringement. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE LICENSOR BE LIABLE
FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES ARISING FROM
THE USE OR INABILITY TO USE THE SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH
DAMAGES.

**Specific notice**: this is a static detection engine and may produce false
positives or false negatives. When used for security purposes it should be combined
with other safeguards and must not be relied upon as the sole basis for a security
decision.

### 6. Termination

All rights granted under this License **terminate automatically and immediately**
upon any violation of its terms. Upon termination you must immediately cease use
and delete all copies of the Software. Section 5 survives termination.

### 7. Governing Law

This License is governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China. Disputes
shall first be resolved through friendly negotiation; failing that, they shall be
submitted to the competent people's court at the Licensor's domicile.

